ViridianCity_School_2F_Text_Placard::
    .string "2F  ATTENTION\p"
    .string "What gets looked at, and what that\n"
    .string "costs everything else.\p"
    .string "You cannot keep what you never\n"
    .string "noticed, so this comes before\l"
    .string "MEMORY.\p"
    .string "The syllabus is on the desk.$"

ViridianCity_School_2F_Text_Syllabus::
    .string "COURSE SYLLABUS\n"
    .string "2F  ATTENTION\p"
    .string "TOPICS: LIMITS, CUES, SEARCH,\n"
    .string "SWITCHING, MISSED.\p"
    .string "All of it is on the board.\n"
    .string "The exam covers the board.\p"
    .string "PASS MARK: 80 out of 100.$"

ViridianCity_School_2F_Text_BoardIntro::
    .string "The board is written up neatly,\n"
    .string "in five parts.$"

ViridianCity_School_2F_Text_Limits::
    .string "LIMITS\p"
    .string "There is only so much of it.\p"
    .string "More on one thing is less on\n"
    .string "everything else.\p"
    .string "It is never added. Only moved.$"

ViridianCity_School_2F_Text_Cues::
    .string "CUES\p"
    .string "A cue says where to look before\n"
    .string "the thing arrives.\p"
    .string "A good cue makes you faster.\p"
    .string "A wrong one makes you slower than\n"
    .string "no cue at all.$"

ViridianCity_School_2F_Text_Search::
    .string "SEARCH\p"
    .string "The more things there are, the\n"
    .string "longer the one you want takes...\p"
    .string "...unless it is the only thing that\n"
    .string "is different.\p"
    .string "The odd one out finds you.$"

ViridianCity_School_2F_Text_Switching::
    .string "SWITCHING\p"
    .string "Changing what you attend to costs\n"
    .string "time, every time.\p"
    .string "Two things at once is nearly always\n"
    .string "one thing, then the other, fast.$"

ViridianCity_School_2F_Text_Missed::
    .string "MISSED\p"
    .string "Watch one thing closely enough and\n"
    .string "something unmissable walks past.\p"
    .string "Nobody who missed it believes\n"
    .string "they did.$"

ViridianCity_School_2F_Text_Teacher::
    .string "ATTENTION.\p"
    .string "You will be tested on what is on\n"
    .string "the board.\p"
    .string "That is also a lesson about\n"
    .string "attention.$"

ViridianCity_School_2F_Text_Wall::
    .string "...and that is why the spotlight\n"
    .string "matters.\p"
    .string "...Oh. You were over there.\p"
    .string "Have I been explaining this to\n"
    .string "the wall?$"

ViridianCity_School_2F_Text_Windows::
    .string "I have read the board eleven\n"
    .string "times.\p"
    .string "I could not tell you how many\n"
    .string "windows this room has.$"
